  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Brookings Partnership 2019-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Brookings Institution plans to undertake a series of research and dialogue activities on the implementation of the SDGs in developing countries the financing for development agenda, and the challenges and prospects for multilateral cooperation. Brookings will inform key stakeholders and decision-makers through rigorous, independent analysis of the issues and provide practical recommendations for meeting global development policy challenges and the promotion of peaceful and inclusive societies.
The Embassy will base the actual support on progress attained in the implementation of the engagement as described in the documentation provided by the grantee. Progress will be measured through the Brookings Institution&#x2019;s monitoring framework. For reporting purposes to Embassy, the following objective, key outcome and outputs have been selected from the grantee monitoring framework to document progress.</narrative>
  </description>
